Package: traverso
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cdrdao, sox
Description: Modern multitrack audio recorder and editor
 Traverso is a multitrack audio recorder and editor with a clean,
 high-performance interface. It features full support for modern
 audio infrastructures like PipeWire, JACK, ALSA, and PortAudio,
 alongside dynamic LV2 plugin hosting and high-quality resampling.
